<title>SWITZERLAND: Fischer says orders/sales up in Jan/Feb.</title>
<headline>Fischer says orders/sales up in Jan/Feb.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAFFHAUSEN, Switzerland 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss engineering group Georg Fischer AG's incoming orders and sales were clearly higher in the first two months of 1997 as compared to the same period last year, chief executive Martin Huber said.</p>
<p>He said the composition of the group had changed, nonetheless the first two months of the year began well for the group's core businesses. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
